prompt.text:
Image 1 is a LAYOUT reference: a pair of ankle boots in a front three-quarter view, exactly as a cartoon avatar wears them, enlarged from a small picture, so it is blurry and dark. Use it ONLY for the shape, size, placement and construction of the boots; do not copy its colours, its darkness or its flaws.
Redraw this same pair of ankle boots as a crisp, clean, high-detail 2D cartoon illustration that uses the full resolution of the canvas, keeping EXACTLY what Image 1 fixes:
- the same two boots in the same places, at the same size and angle, with the same outer outlines: the left boot on the left, the right boot on the right; do not move, rotate, enlarge, shrink, re-pose or re-proportion them;
- the same construction: a smooth pull-on ankle boot whose shaft ends just above the ankle, a rounded toe, a low stacked heel and a thick sole;
- the same shaft opening: the top edge of each shaft follows Image 1's opening exactly, neither higher up the leg nor lower into the boot.
Change what Image 1 gets wrong:
- each shaft has a rim band around its top, a narrow band bounded above by the shaft's top edge and below by one continuous, unbroken seam line that goes all the way round, so the rim band is clearly its own band;
- the sole is separated from the upper by one continuous, unbroken welt line all the way round;
- clean shaft edges: nothing sticks up from the shaft's corners or its top edge, no thin lines, hairs or spikes, and the top edge is one smooth curve;
- no skin-coloured, orange, cream or light specks anywhere along the shaft's top edge or inside the opening;
- the leather is a warm medium tan-brown, clearly lighter than Image 1 but clearly darker than skin; the rim band is the same leather; the sole is a darker brown;
- real drawn detail: crisp dark seam lines and soft painted shading and highlights that show the boot's volume.
Style: a clean cartoon style with smooth dark brown outlines of even weight and clean anti-aliased edges, thin dark seam lines, and soft painted shading and highlights. No texture noise, no photographic detail, no stitching, no logos, no text, no laces, no buckles, no zips, and no decorations that Image 1 does not have.
The boots are worn: each leg goes into its boot, so the opening at the top of each shaft is EMPTY and fully transparent, with no inner lining, no sock, no foot, no skin and no leg.
No ground, no cast shadow, no reflection, no background: everything outside the two boots is fully transparent. No other objects.
